{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44249","headline":"和新及第悼亡诗二首 一 · 鱼玄机","name":"和新及第悼亡诗二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙籍人间不久留，片时已过十经秋。\n鸳鸯帐下香犹暖，鹦鹉笼中语未休。\n朝露缀花如脸恨，晚风敧柳似眉愁。\n彩云一去无消息，潘岳多情欲白头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鱼玄机","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44249.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44249","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}